+Do not impose one universal precedence order on every Markdown file. Use the
+document type for its intended responsibility:
+
+| Types | Completion role | Meaning |
+|---|---|---|
+| `project`, `architecture`, `governance`, `decision`, `convention` | `constraint` | Current scope, structure, policy, decision, or implementation rule |
+| `plan` | `coordination` | Durable stages, blockers, handoffs, and completion state |
+| `runbook` | `procedure` | An operational sequence that changed behavior may invalidate |
+| `map`, `analysis`, `evidence`, `external-snapshot` | evidence or index | Select and cite when needed, but do not turn them into a routine update checklist |
+
